<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
  <key>Label</key><string>com.nakshiq.social-local</string>
  <!-- ALL THREE reels: the founder-voice reel (T1), the Friday road reel (T2),
       and — since 2026-09-15 — the daily automated reel, which moved here from
       GitHub Actions. GHA fires scheduled workflows 2-3.5h late, so the
       "47 6 * * *" cron meant to hit 12:17 IST actually posted at 14:13-15:46
       IST every day, throwing away the noon slot our own ledger picked
       (median reach 142 at noon vs 109 at 18:00). launchd fires on time.

       FOUR fire times, not one, for two separate reasons:
       (a) a single daily launchd fire drops a day on network loss;
       (b) Canberra goes AEDT on 2026-10-04, which shifts local time against
           IST by an hour. Under AEST these land at 11:35/12:05/12:35/13:05
           IST; under AEDT at 10:35/11:05/11:35/12:05 IST. run-social-local.sh
           gates on IST >= 11:30 and writes a per-IST-date marker, so exactly
           one fire publishes and the rest are no-ops in either offset.
       Do not reduce the fire list without reading that gate.

       Install: cp nakshiq-autoposter/com.nakshiq.social-local.plist ~/Library/LaunchAgents/ &&
                launchctl load ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.nakshiq.social-local.plist -->
  <key>ProgramArguments</key>
  <array>
    <string>/bin/bash</string>
    <string>/Users/ashishtaneja/Desktop/India Travel Planner/nakshiq-autoposter/run-social-local.sh</string>
  </array>
  <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
  <dict>
    <key>PATH</key><string>/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/local/bin:/Users/ashishtaneja/.local/bin:/Users/ashishtaneja/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin</string>
  </dict>
  <key>StartCalendarInterval</key>
  <array>
    <dict><key>Hour</key><integer>16</integer><key>Minute</key><integer>5</integer></dict>
    <dict><key>Hour</key><integer>16</integer><key>Minute</key><integer>35</integer></dict>
    <dict><key>Hour</key><integer>17</integer><key>Minute</key><integer>5</integer></dict>
    <dict><key>Hour</key><integer>17</integer><key>Minute</key><integer>35</integer></dict>
  </array>
  <key>StandardOutPath</key><string>/Users/ashishtaneja/.claude/social-local.log</string>
  <key>StandardErrorPath</key><string>/Users/ashishtaneja/.claude/social-local.log</string>
  <key>RunAtLoad</key><false/>
</dict>
</plist>
